  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "進階影像處理",
    "sub_ename": "ADVANCED IMAGE PROCESSING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在介紹影像處理結合人工智慧在現代生活中的各種進階應用。課程內容從包含物件辨識、物件分割、影像強化、超解析度和生成模型等。帶領學生了解在類神經網路在影像處理上的潛力，並學習將人工智慧應用到各種不同的應用情境。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces various advanced image processing applications in modern life. The course content includes object recognition & segmentation, image enhancement, super-resolution and generative models, etc. After taking this course, the students will understand the potential of neural network in image processing, and learn to apply artificial intelligence to various application scenarios.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
